      "title": "START HERE — LoRA + Two Samplers",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Krea 2 Double Sampler with KGodRays LoRA\n\nThe LoRA is inserted in the **model path before sampling**, so both samplers use it.\n\n- Start at strength **0.70**.\n- Compare against workflow 03 with the same prompt and seed.\n- If the rays overpower the scene, reduce LoRA strength before changing sampler settings.\n- Pass 1 creates; Pass 2 refines at denoise **0.25**.\n\nThe three saved outputs reveal what Pass 2 and sharpening each contribute."
      ],
